      "text": "Examples: [Huai Shan](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/common-yam-rhizome) sweet, neutral; [Yu Zhu](https://herbaltcm.sn.polyu.edu.hk/herbal/fragrant-solomonseal-rhizome) sweet, slightly cold.",
